    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="0470" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg464"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Señor
                            Hurtado.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-03-22"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 21st instant, and to inclose herewith a half-dozen copies of
                    the President’s proclamation of the 15th instant, suspending the free admission
                    into the United States of certain articles the production of the Republic of
                    Colombia.</p>
                <p>The brief delay in making formal communication of the President’s action has been
                    occasioned in order to permit the proclamation to be printed.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d435-a1.xml" xpointer="d435-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
